Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Qué me pasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:01.26,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Por qué no me siento
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:02.06,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}suficiente?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te pasa esto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:03.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Dices que sí a todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:04.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}para que nadie se enfade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:04.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}contigo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.91,0:00:05.80,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te comparas con la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.70,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que los demás enseñan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:07.71,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por redes y que sabes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:08.22,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que es falsa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:09.49,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te prometes cosas que luego
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:10.05,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no cumples
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:10.87,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Necesitas que alguien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:11.79,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te valide para sentir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:12.33,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que vales
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:12.99,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Tapas lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:13.58,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con el móvil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:14.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con la fiesta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:15.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con los videojuegos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:15.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}o con el alcohol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.06,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Consumes cada día justo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:17.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que te baja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:18.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.18,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Hablas desde la queja todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:19.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}el puto día
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:20.58,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te rodeas de gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:21.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que te resta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:22.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que no tiene ambición
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:22.82,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Nunca te paras a estar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:23.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en silencio y a escuchar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:24.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.40,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y vives en tu cabeza
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pensando sin parar y nunca
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.55,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te has parado a mirar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.55,0:00:28.62,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de dónde viene todo eso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que es de lo que viviste
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:29.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de pequeño
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:30.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que no te hace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:31.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}falta quererte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:31.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te sobra todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.76,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que te quita energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:33.49,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Empieza por una
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:33.97,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la que más te ha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:34.97,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}dolido escucharla
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y verás cómo cambia todo
